WEBVTT

00:14:57.684 --> 00:15:01.605
think, at some point in your life,
have you changed?

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:04.608
And if yes, if you did,

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:06.068
why can't they?

00:15:06.109 --> 00:15:07.277
Thank you.

00:15:09.655 --> 00:15:16.578
(Applause and cheers)

00:15:22.584 --> 00:15:24.795
Helen Walters: That's amazing,
you're amazing.

00:15:25.963 --> 00:15:28.674
You also just got back from Ukraine,

00:15:28.674 --> 00:15:31.593
and I wanted to show us
just another piece of your work.